Changes: the files under jumper/ are new or modified copies of files of that repository at
commit 61d065219fca767f3142c8f10aff59eae5a5a004; jumper_patch/jumper-sumo.patch lists every
change against that commit (the sumo task, the tactician, the referee, the ceremony, and small
changes to the simulation backend, the posture task and the experiment settings).

The checkpoints in models/ were trained from the official walking policy of that repository
with the code in this project.

Everything in the video and in tools/ is our own: the arena, crowd, cup and graphics, and the
music and sound, which are synthesized in code.
